WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Nam Illam: from receipt to pantry.
Scan. Check. Choose. Save. Sample data shown.

00:07.000 --> 00:17.000
Open Home, then Expenses, then Scan receipt.
Photograph the full receipt or choose a photo.

00:17.000 --> 00:29.000
Check the amount and currency against your receipt.
Edit names, prices and quantities before saving.

00:29.000 --> 00:42.000
Use Add all, or tap individual item cards.
Choose food kept at home. Leave meals out unselected.

00:42.000 --> 00:53.000
Review your choices. Save & update pantry for selected items,
or save the expense without adding inventory.

00:53.000 --> 01:00.000
Scan. Review. Choose. Save.
Always check scanned details against the original receipt.
